# A Room is cast as one of its doors (CR 709.3a): only that door is evaluated, so Aminatou's "its mana cost reduced by {4}"
# is the door's. Bot1 reveals Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber, drawn first on turn 3, and casts it as Ritual Chamber
# ({3}{B}{B}) for {B}{B} out of {B}{B}{C}{C}, leaving {C}{C} (the whole card's {5}{B}{B}{B} less four would not be paid
# by that, and Unholy Annex's {B} would leave {B}{C}{C}). The door unlocks as it enters and makes its Demon (CR 709.5h).
[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Aminatou, Veil Piercer
Island
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Island
Island x15
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
